skills/work-planner/artifacts/acceptance-criteria.md:63: section outside the set: Commands
skills/work-planner/artifacts/acceptance-criteria.md:21: list step in heading model: 1. Confirm the supplied delivery findings establish [Readiness](#readiness) for each selected criterion.
skills/work-planner/artifacts/acceptance-criteria.md:22: indented detail in heading model: - Return evidence that fails Readiness as a blocker for that criterion.
skills/work-planner/artifacts/acceptance-criteria.md:23: list step in heading model: 2. Run each criterion's named instrument at the delivering pull request head for an open task, or its merged revision for delivered work, meeting [Instrument Checkout](#instrument-checkout).
skills/work-planner/artifacts/acceptance-criteria.md:24: indented detail in heading model: - Run [Run at Revision](#run-at-revision) with the project checkout, that revision and the instrument.
skills/work-planner/artifacts/acceptance-criteria.md:25: indented detail in heading model: - Record the result against the commit it reports, meeting [Instrument Result](#instrument-result).
skills/work-planner/artifacts/acceptance-criteria.md:26: list step in heading model: 3. Return verified criterion ids with their evidence and each unresolved criterion with what is missing.
skills/work-planner/artifacts/acceptance-criteria.md:27: indented detail in heading model: - Leave body publication and further planning to the caller.
skills/work-planner/artifacts/acceptance-criteria.md:35: list step in heading model: 1. Record the criteria, meeting [Tick State](#tick-state).
skills/work-planner/artifacts/acceptance-criteria.md:36: indented detail in heading model: - For an epic, run [Record Epic Criteria](epic-issue-body.md#record-epic-criteria) with the issue JSON, pull request records, complete issue-link snapshot, verified criterion ids and output body file.
skills/work-planner/artifacts/acceptance-criteria.md:37: indented detail in heading model: - For an initiative, run [Record Initiative Criteria](initiative-issue-body.md#record-initiative-criteria) with the issue JSON, every linked epic record, verified criterion ids and output body file.
skills/work-planner/artifacts/acceptance-criteria.md:38: list step in heading model: 2. Return the resulting body and any refused criteria to the caller for publication.
