skills/work-planner/artifacts/initiative.md:13: list step in heading model: 1. Evaluate the supplied evidence against [Delivery State](#delivery-state).
skills/work-planner/artifacts/initiative.md:14: list step in heading model: 2. Identify each missing, open or cancelled epic, each unverified or unticked criterion, and each unmerged or unreadable Development-linked pull request. Incomplete link evidence leaves completion unconfirmed.
skills/work-planner/artifacts/initiative.md:15: list step in heading model: 3. Return the completion result and its supporting issue identities, evidence revisions and blockers. Passing normal delivery checks supplies the caller's closure evidence; the tracker issue's current Development-link gate still governs the write.
