skills/work-planner/artifacts/pull-request-body.md:61: list step in heading model: 2. Inspect the diff. A checked list and Test/Criteria table convert only when their ids agree and every line is accounted for; descriptions and coverage are preserved.
skills/work-planner/artifacts/pull-request-body.md:62: list step in heading model: 3. Verify retained result links against [Test Plan](#test-plan). A checked entry without linked result evidence remains pending; restore its Pass result only from verified published evidence.
